{"beats": [{"id": "b1", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.6, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Hey. Great to be here. Although I'm not sure where else I could be.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b2", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "look left", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Been enjoying the weather. For rain... there must be a cloud?", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b3", "pause_after_ms": 1500, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.9, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "I drive myself crazy with that stuff. I traced it back as far as I could. Then I gave up. That's the whole religion.", "type": "punchline"}, {"id": "b4", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Six years, no food. Breath and bones. My legs complained.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b5", "pause_after_ms": 500, "performance": {"expression": "grin", "gesture": "small gesture", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.6, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "So I ate rice. Middle way. Not too much, not too little. Porridge solved metaphysics.", "type": "tag"}, {"id": "b6", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.5, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Then one talk. Four truths. Suffering, cause, end, path. Eight steps. Nobody clapped.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b7", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.6, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "The elders say save yourself. Very DIY. Very quiet.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b8", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "normal", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.6, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Bodhisattvas say save everyone first. Group project. Nobody graduates.", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b9", "pause_after_ms": 1500, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.9, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Zen says just sit. I sat. Tibet added a hundred deities and a rainbow body. I asked for tea.", "type": "punchline"}, {"id": "b10", "pause_after_ms": 600, "performance": {"expression": "neutral", "gesture": "shrug", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 0.6, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Fourteen questions I refused. Universe eternal? I said: did you do the dishes?", "type": "setup"}, {"id": "b11", "pause_after_ms": 1500, "performance": {"expression": "deadpan", "gesture": "hold still", "look": "audience"}, "speech": {"emphasis": 1.0, "pace": "normal"}, "text": "Don't cling. Goodnight.", "type": "closer"}], "metadata": {"beat_count": 11, "punchline_count": 2, "total_duration_ms": 61000, "word_count": 140}, "profile": {"energy": 0.4, "eye_contact": 0.85, "gesture_frequency": 0.2, "movement": 0.25, "pace": 0.82, "punchline_hold_ms": 1500}, "version": "freaktown.delivery.v1", "voice": {"provider": "edge-tts", "voice_id": "en-US-GuyNeural"}}